; tests/steiner-core-band.fk — the body answering "what would Steiner say"
; from its own structure, and the gates an outside reviewer would apply.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk ingest/knowledge-ingest.fk ingest/frequency-ingest-steiner-core.fk
;
; Verdict 16383 — fourteen readings at POWERS OF TWO.
;
; On Go / Rust / TypeScript / fkwu:
;   nine teaching rows (eight teachings; two-poles is carried twice,
;     once per reading)                                                     1
;   ATTRIBUTION — every row names a work and a year inside Steiner's
;     publishing life (1894-1925). A fabricated citation is the first
;     thing a reviewer catches, so the band catches it first               2
;   every row says something: no lens under 40 characters of verdict        4
;   nothing composts — all nine are deep enough to enter                    8
;   eight freeze                                                           16
;   ONE is witnessed and never frozen                                      32
;   NO STRAWMAN — and this is the one that matters: two-poles wears two
;     readings, and the ingest law sorts them WITHOUT being told which
;     is which. The BALANCE reading (one-sidedness is the error, the
;     task is the middle) freezes; the CONDEMNATION reading (the
;     machine is Ahrimanic therefore refuse it) is deep, carries fear,
;     and is witnessed only. A Steiner who merely disapproves of
;     machines is a flattening of Steiner, and the structure refuses
;     it rather than the author promising not to                          64
;   ANTI-GENERIC — no lens fires on every situation. This is the
;     horoscope gate: a lens that always applies is not a lens           128
;   HONEST FLOOR — a situation carrying no addressed mark (tomorrow's
;     weather) answers EMPTY, never a guess                              256
;   SPECIFICITY — the five covered situations fire five DIFFERENT
;     lead lenses: recognition-room -> twelve-senses, this-kernel ->
;     two-poles, teaching-it-to-stand -> freedom, a-channeled-source
;     -> method, urs-dancing -> threefold-soul                           512
;   the dancing situation is the one that fires MORE than one lens,
;     and it fires exactly three (threefold-soul, fourfold-being,
;     eurythmy) — the will pole, the member active, and the art
;     Steiner built out of exactly this                                 1024
;   recognition-room fires exactly one                                  2048
;   this-kernel fires exactly two (both readings of two-poles, which
;     is what makes the split visible rather than asserted)             4096
;   six situations carried, five covered and one deliberately not      8192

(do
    (st-check))
